    "label": "Problem 8",
    "statement": "Design a Turing machine that subtracts one from a binary numeral, outputting zero when the input is zero. The tape starts with the numeral of x written between two asterisk markers, with the head on the right marker. The machine must halt leaving one well-formed block containing the binary numeral of x - 1 when x is at least one, and the numeral 0 when x is zero, ending with the head on the block's right marker.",
